# Overlay patch -- a deliberate artifact, not an unfinished diff.
#
# This repository does not vendor its upstream bases. `setup.sh --agentic`
# clones kokolerk/TCOD at pinned commit 465eef4 and applies this patch over
# it (7 files, +130/-26), then installs the DTDD workflows as new files.
# `git apply --check` passes against a clean checkout of that commit.
#
# None of these hunks is the method: they are harness fixes every long run
# needed (sqlite session retries, SIGBUS protection, resume guards, LoRA
# adapter waits) plus two lines registering the DTDD workflow names.
# PATCH_NOTES.md in this directory explains each hunk and why it exists.
#
# Text before the first "diff --git" line is ignored by git apply.

